  "prefLabel": "Pda 605.05 Notification of Changes in Wait List Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 605.05 Notification of Changes in Wait List Information. In order to maintain updated information with the division, any person on a wait list shall notify the division in writing, within 30 days of the change, of any change of address or telephone number.\n\nSource. #8321, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10441, eff 11-1-13; ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
